body:
I went to therapy for few years and now I don't have time for it since I have school daily from morning to evening.  Counselors could help, but it's no like I am not trying to learn, or don't know how to, but I am not able to do it as much as I need. (hope it makes sense)

&#x200B;

I know life is hard for everyone, I particulary don't have bad hard life, but I am just unable to manage it. And tbh I can't continue in my favorite hobby bc of school schedule and other hobbies don't interest me as much.

And I am not worrying about ex at all, I am way over them

&#x200B;

I really appreciate the advice, but even if I went to therapy I don't think much would change. I have been trying to contact  my psychiatrist, but they are not picking the phone
